      "title": "SUFFOC Mid-Week Street-O 2 Hardwick",
      "date": "2026-12-08",
      "level": "Local",
      "series": "Mid-Week Street-O",
      "area": "Hardwick",
      "about": "<p>Suffolk Orienteering Club presents 6 informal evening street-O events this winter, using the Maprun app on your mobile phone. </p><p>Each event will be launched on the second Tuesday of the month, but will remain available to run in your own time for 4 weeks following the event date. </p><p>The 6-event series will be a mini-league format with prizes awarded at the end of the season for best performance for both men and women. The best five out of 6 scores will be added up for the overall total. </p><p>As these events are street events, entries can only be made by over-16s. Under-16s can be accompanied by a responsible adult. </p><p>We will meet at or near a pub on the day of the event, and hope that you will join us afterwards for a social drink and/or food (and a debrief). </p><p>Don't forget to bring a torch!</p>",
